{"id":"metal","lemma":"metal","pos":"noun","rank":1916,"glosses":["metal"],"ipa":"/meˈtal/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"metales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-metal.wav","examples":[{"text":"El plomo es un metal.","en":"Lead is a metal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441848"},{"text":"Los ácidos actúan sobre los metales.","en":"Acids act on metals.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1253536"},{"text":"El aluminio es un metal.","en":"Aluminum is a metal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/557523"},{"text":"Me corté con una sierra para metales.","en":"I cut myself with a hacksaw.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515114"},{"text":"¿Esto está hecho de madera o de metal?","en":"Is it made of wood or metal?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589747"}]}